From 331ca334bc7848740bb526617aede6d3c2715d56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] avalanche: restore soft block parking and 25% staking rewards

Enable soft block parking and the 25% Avalanche staking reward payout
in V2 coinbases.

Original-Commit: 3c056f5a35da20a24e716f9a840dbf9a860e7d5d
Original-Patch: v2/021
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

(cherry picked from commit a91f71f29d9a58556bc8a96bb2c3facea434c119)

